### Test Notification service bang extension REST Client trong VS Code (bam "Send Request" tren tung request)
### Can chay: Docker (Postgres + RabbitMQ), Identity (5101), Notification (5105)
@host = http://localhost:5105
@identity = http://localhost:5101

### 1. Service con song khong -> 200 {"status":"ok"}
GET {{host}}/health

### 2. Dang nhap de lay token (dung tai khoan da dang ky o Identity)
# @name login
POST {{identity}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "champ@test.com",
  "password": "12345678"
}

### 3. Danh sach thong bao cua toi -> 200, {"unreadCount":..., "items":[...]}
GET {{host}}/api/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 4. Danh dau tat ca da doc -> 204 (goi lai request 3: unreadCount = 0)
POST {{host}}/api/notifications/read-all
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 5. Khong gui token -> 401 (bao mat)
GET {{host}}/api/notifications

### 6. Danh dau mot thong bao khong ton tai -> 404
POST {{host}}/api/notifications/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/read
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Muon co thong bao de xem: dung RabbitMQ Management (http://localhost:15672) -> Exchanges -> treeo.events
### -> Publish message, hoac gui tu Garden (xong 3 ngay tuoi lien tiep) / Reminder (nang nong).
### Chi tiet xem HUONG-DAN-THAN.md muc "Test RabbitMQ".
